  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a comal or large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the oyster mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown.",
    "Add the flour and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Gradually add the beef broth, whisking continuously to avoid lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the dashi extract, miso paste, and nutritional yeast.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the gravy hot over toast or rice, garnished with parsley.",
    "Reheat leftovers in the microwave or on the stovetop before serving."
